    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 12 Chestnut Lawn a well-presented, three bedroomed semi-detached home, situated on the front tow of this highly regarded development in Johnstown Wood. \n\nExtending to approximately 95sqm, this attractive property offers well-proportioned accommodation and modern family living. Internally the accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and provides a comfortable balance of living and bedroom space, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or investors. \n\nThe front of the property is fully walled; entrance piers open onto a spacious concreted driveway which provides ample off street car parking. A gated side access leads through to a beautifully maintained and thoughtfully landscaped rear garden. The garden features a central lawn, bordered by a concrete pathway which leads up to a useful garden shed with a concrete base and power. \n\nThe property is ideally positioned within Johnstown Wood, a well-established residential development with a range of local amenities, schools, shops and recreational facilities nearby. Navan town centre is also within easy reach, providing an extensive selection of shopping, dining and leisure options, together with excellent transport links. \n\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 1.85m x 4.86m \nA beautiful welcome to this home fitted with wide plank laminate flooring and useful understairs storage. Also hosts Guest WC 1.62m x 0.7m Fully tiled and fitted with wc and whb. \n\nLivingroom 3.41m x 5.59m \nA fantastic sized living room with bay window. Fitted with wide plank laminate flooring and central fireplace which is fitted with a Henley inset stove. Double doors lead through to…\n\nKitchen/Diner 3.56m x 5.41m \nSpanning the entire width of the rear of the property and fitted with wide plank laminate flooring throughout. Fitted with modern shaker units, incorporating a concealed laundry press, island which provides additional storage and finished off with a quartz effect laminate worktop. Sliding patio doors lead out to the rear garden. \n \nLanding 2.12m x 1.95m\nHosts hot-press and provides access to the attic. \n\nMaster Bedroom 3.43m x 3.83m\nSpacious master bedroom which is located to the rear of the property and is fitted with built in wardrobes. \n\nEn-Suite 1.88m x 1.65m \nA stylish en-suite which is fully tiled and fitted with wc, whb with vanity unit and power shower. \n\nBedroom 2 2.97m x 3.44m \nLocated to the front of the property - fitted with built in wardrobes. \n\nBedroom 3 2.34m x 2.79m \nAlso located to the front of the property and fitted with built in wardrobes. \n\nBathroom 1.89m x 1.81m \nFully tiled and fitted with wc, whb and bath with shower attachment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Attractive three bedroomed semi-detached home. \nWell-proportioned accommodation of c. 95sqm.\nIdeally position on the front row of this sought after development.\nWidened front driveway, providing ample off-street parking. \nServices: Gas fired central heating, mains water and mains sewage. \nBER: C2. BER Number: 114327034\nExcellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or investors. \nConvenient location close to Johnstown Shopping Centre. \nEasy access to both the R147, R153 & M3 without having to travel through Navan town."
      },
